<title>SRI LANKA: Cricket-Sri Lanka and India draw first test match.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sri Lanka and India draw first test match.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first test between Sri Lanka and India ended in a draw on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 1st innings 537-8 declared; Sri Lanka 952-6 (S.Jayasuriya 340, R.Mahanama 225, A.de Silva 126, M.Jayawardene 66)</p>
